                                   "title":  "Reviews - Goodbye Tsugumi | The StoryGraph",
                                   "snippet":  "Even though Tsugumi can be insensitive, selfish and astonishingly mean, she is also fiercely loyal to those she loves/cares for, spirited, incredibly strong-willed, ruminant and so much more. It is clear that despite her air of nonchalance, Tsugumi feels things immensely and those feelings consume her entire being.",
