                                   "title":  "Wikipedia: Goodbye Tsugumi",
                                   "snippet":  "[Wikipedia Synopsis] Goodbye Tsugumi (Japanese: TUGUMI; written in allcaps rōmaji) is a novel written by Japanese author Banana Yoshimoto in 1989 and translated into English in 2002 by Michael Emmerich.\nGoodbye Tsugumi was made into a movie in 1990, directed by Jun Ichikawa.",
